OL,3,CCrews tackle huge industrial estate
OL,4,Cfire as locals warned to keep windows
OL,5,Cshut
OL,7,FFire crews are still battling a large-
OL,8,Fscale blaze that broke out overnight
OL,9,Fat an industrial estate in Caerleon
OL,10,Fnear Newport.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called to Star
OL,13,FTrading Estate at around 2:40am on
OL,14,FSaturday morning.
OL,16,FTen fire engines were sent to the
OL,17,Flocation after reports of a fire at
OL,18,Fthe scene, South Wales Fire & Rescue
OL,19,FService said.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
