OL,3,CCrews tackle huge industrial estate
OL,4,Cfire as locals warned to keep windows
OL,5,Cshut
OL,7,FA statement from fire service said the
OL,8,Fsite has been evacuated, with everyone
OL,9,Faccounted for.
OL,11,FIt continued: "Members of the public
OL,12,Fare urged to avoid the area to allow
OL,13,Femergency services to carry out their
OL,14,Fwork,"
OL,16,F"Due to smoke in the vicinity,
OL,17,Fresidents are also advised to keep
OL,18,Fwindows and doors closed."
