OL,3,CCrews tackle huge industrial estate
OL,4,Cfire as locals warned to keep windows
OL,5,Cshut
OL,7,FMeanwhile, Public Health Wales has
OL,8,Furged people travelling nearby to
OL,9,F"keep your vehicle windows and air
OL,10,Fvents closed and switch aircon mode to
OL,11,Frecirculate."
OL,13,FLocals have been sharing videos and
OL,14,Fimages of the blaze on social media,
OL,15,Fwhich shows huge flames coming from
OL,16,Fthe building along with large amounts
OL,17,Fof smoke.
